WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.980
<b><i>We look the same, but men call us monsters. 

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:40.970
<b>Edo Castle</b>

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:44.550
A truly joyous occasion.

00:00:44.550 --> 00:00:49.520
I am told it is thanks to Tenkai-dono 
that the castle has disappeared.

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:52.280
Impressive...

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:56.280
I am terribly sorry.

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:59.470
The Murakumo disappeared?

00:00:59.470 --> 00:01:02.090
Destroyed, I would understand, but...

00:01:02.090 --> 00:01:04.290
How was this done?

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:07.170
The work of some supernatural creature?

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:45.010
<b><i>The Shielding Eye Is Deceived</i></b>

00:02:45.340 --> 00:02:46.520
Thanks for the meal!

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:47.890
Thank you.

00:02:48.160 --> 00:02:50.910
Hey... It was over there, right?

00:02:51.840 --> 00:02:53.250
That strange castle.

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:54.070
Yes.

00:02:54.070 --> 00:02:55.800
I wish I could've seen it...

00:02:55.800 --> 00:02:58.080
I hope it comes back.

00:02:58.080 --> 00:02:59.980
I don't think it will.

00:03:01.210 --> 00:03:02.950
Ever again.

00:03:05.560 --> 00:03:08.040
Oh, you're working in the shop again?

00:03:08.690 --> 00:03:10.790
I'm fine now.

00:03:11.110 --> 00:03:15.260
But it took so long for you to wake up...

00:03:25.570 --> 00:03:27.280
Hachisu?

00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:29.840
Hibiki, you're awake.

00:03:29.840 --> 00:03:31.850
Where's Hachirou?

00:03:33.210 --> 00:03:34.810
Where's Hachirou?

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:41.320
I see.

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:43.950
He doesn't get it.

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:48.790
I knew Hachirou wouldn't get it.

00:03:51.170 --> 00:03:51.710
Rui...

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:53.360
You're back.

00:03:54.260 --> 00:03:55.430
Thanks.

00:03:55.430 --> 00:04:00.240
And sorry, but could you and 
Utsutsu patrol tonight, too?

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:04.570
I was asked to run an errand, so I'll be at 
Namenba and Gorone-dono's place.

00:04:04.570 --> 00:04:05.720
Okay.

00:04:06.060 --> 00:04:11.770
But how long are we going to keep 
patrolling, even during the day?

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:14.100
We still don't know what 
happened to the Joujinshuu.

00:04:14.410 --> 00:04:17.230
At least, that's what Gorone-dono says.

00:04:33.270 --> 00:04:36.460
How long is this going to take?

00:04:38.270 --> 00:04:40.950
Damn, now I've gotta go, too...

00:04:40.950 --> 00:04:44.510
I can't take my Saibougu off here.

00:05:02.220 --> 00:05:04.020
Use leaves.

00:05:04.020 --> 00:05:06.660
Even cheap paper is expensive.

00:05:06.870 --> 00:05:09.000
Harsh...

00:05:09.860 --> 00:05:11.490
Spring is so awful.

00:05:13.170 --> 00:05:16.270
So you're back to being Lazy Gorone again?

00:05:16.610 --> 00:05:19.920
When they were here, 
you had your act together.

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:24.250
Sounds like you want them to come back.

00:05:24.250 --> 00:05:26.720
Don't say that, even if it's only a joke!

00:05:27.810 --> 00:05:33.680
But the way the Joujinshuu and 
the Murakumo just vanished...

00:05:34.290 --> 00:05:36.440
If anything, it's more suspicious.

00:05:36.720 --> 00:05:41.440
But we saw it burn and shatter ourselves.

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:44.190
You saw it burn until there was nothing left?

00:05:44.540 --> 00:05:45.780
No...

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:48.190
But it disappeared.

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:50.250
It disappeared, but that's all.

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:53.200
It's too early to sleep soundly at night.

00:06:23.530 --> 00:06:25.690
Who's there? Is someone there?

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:34.280
What?

00:06:36.650 --> 00:06:37.570
Impossible.

00:06:57.650 --> 00:07:00.050
Who's there?! Show yourself.

00:07:00.050 --> 00:07:01.880
Are you some sort of monster?

00:07:02.160 --> 00:07:03.730
You won't be able to use your magic on me.

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:06.220
Show yourself.

00:07:09.340 --> 00:07:10.570
Shichigen...

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:12.810
Shichigen.

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:15.960
Shichigen...

00:07:17.440 --> 00:07:18.580
Mother?

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:21.090
Shichigen...

00:07:22.320 --> 00:07:24.750
Mother!

00:07:26.860 --> 00:07:29.100
Mother!

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:40.810
Shichigen. Shichigen.

00:08:12.360 --> 00:08:14.300
I saw nothing.

00:08:14.820 --> 00:08:16.180
I mustn't... have looked.

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:31.690
Wait! You can't do this!

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:34.920
Please! Give us the money you said you would!

00:08:34.920 --> 00:08:36.810
Then, come with me to the inn.

00:08:36.810 --> 00:08:39.450
Many people there would pay a hefty price.

00:08:40.270 --> 00:08:41.700
Nonsense.

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:44.210
Stop it! Let me go!

00:08:44.590 --> 00:08:46.070
Let me go!

00:09:14.430 --> 00:09:15.890
I saw nothing...

00:09:16.460 --> 00:09:18.710
I mustn't... have looked.

00:09:31.520 --> 00:09:36.690
Combining our techniques worked splendidly.

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:43.430
<b>Adamantite Prison</b>

00:09:40.210 --> 00:09:43.430
I captured him within the Adamantite Prison.

00:09:44.050 --> 00:09:47.440
And the statue of Kannon was 
Demon Beast Summoning.

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:47.440
<b>Demon Beast Summoning</b>

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:52.690
<b>Destiny's Passage</b>

00:09:48.930 --> 00:09:52.690
And Destiny's Passage showed 
him a terrible sight.

00:09:52.950 --> 00:09:58.950
Now, that man will always be 
our slave, no matter what.

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:14.380
<b>Kyoto</b>

00:10:19.560 --> 00:10:22.440
A question. Is this where Honnouji is?

00:10:23.190 --> 00:10:27.440
Honnouji? That's near Kamagawa Village.

00:10:27.440 --> 00:10:29.480
No. The old one.

00:10:30.240 --> 00:10:32.480
The one where Nobunaga-dono was slain.

00:10:32.780 --> 00:10:36.770
Oh, that's just up ahead, you're right.

00:10:36.770 --> 00:10:39.080
But there's nothing there now.

00:10:39.080 --> 00:10:42.740
No, isn't there? You know, the ghost.

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:44.120
The ghost?

00:10:44.350 --> 00:10:48.350
Well, a lot of people have said 
they've seen ghosts, lately.

00:10:48.350 --> 00:10:51.380
Pale shadows, moving around at night.

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:56.420
They say that, perhaps, Nobunaga-sama's 
soul is wandering there, trapped.

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:15.270
A shard of glass?

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:26.540
Secretly running away again?

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:33.040
Saizou...

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:36.850
That isn't a nice thing to say.
I'm not running anywhere.

00:11:37.950 --> 00:11:41.570
But you don't plan to come back, either.

00:11:41.570 --> 00:11:44.680
Just like always, you never 
make up your mind, leader.

00:11:44.910 --> 00:11:48.050
You put those around you ahead of yourself.

00:11:48.050 --> 00:11:52.820
But then you say you don't want 
your bloodline binding you.

00:11:53.930 --> 00:11:57.170
Shichigen, Shikibu, and the Igas...

00:11:57.170 --> 00:12:00.070
They've spent their whole lives 
waiting for a word from their leader.

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:03.200
You know that, right?

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:06.280
Well?

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:09.140
I'm going to accept that offer.

00:12:09.140 --> 00:12:10.450
That offer?

00:12:11.260 --> 00:12:14.510
The one that involves Joujin 
trying to revive Nobunaga.

00:12:17.010 --> 00:12:22.220
<i>If I can meet Nobunaga's ghost, 
that would make this faster.</i>

00:13:15.880 --> 00:13:17.150
Hachirou?

00:13:19.600 --> 00:13:20.630
Why?

00:13:22.920 --> 00:13:24.300
Joujin is here.

00:13:25.670 --> 00:13:26.780
He's close.

00:13:27.310 --> 00:13:28.330
We have to run.

00:13:28.330 --> 00:13:29.150
It's too late.

00:13:29.150 --> 00:13:29.780
But...

00:13:42.140 --> 00:13:45.490
It's too late, Hibiki.

00:13:46.530 --> 00:13:52.060
So now, I'm going to tell 
you how I really feel.

00:13:54.840 --> 00:13:56.060
I love you.

00:13:58.000 --> 00:14:01.640
You'll be mine, won't you, Hibiki?

00:14:09.100 --> 00:14:11.260
Yes. Forever.

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:14.600
I want you!

00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:15.600
Me, too!

00:14:17.310 --> 00:14:18.710
I see.

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:20.830
You'll be mine, then?

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:53.120
Kouga Hachirou?

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:56.120
I see you're no ghost.

00:14:56.380 --> 00:14:58.310
Nonsense...

00:14:58.310 --> 00:15:02.000
Did you think that would be enough 
to destroy the Joujinshuu?

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:03.890
Of course not.

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:07.880
Why have you appeared here, Kujaku Tsuibamu?

00:15:08.140 --> 00:15:11.140
That's my line.

00:15:12.170 --> 00:15:16.640
Are you trying to revive Nobunaga?

00:15:17.420 --> 00:15:18.900
I see.

00:15:18.900 --> 00:15:21.650
That is what you have come to learn?

00:15:32.520 --> 00:15:36.510
Either way, it is a strange fate that 
brought us here, together.

00:15:37.130 --> 00:15:39.660
May I ask you for a duel?

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:43.830
You would fight me with that branch?

00:15:45.910 --> 00:15:49.590
It is spring, and the cherry 
blossoms are in bloom.

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:51.550
I thought it would be entertaining, perhaps.

00:15:51.790 --> 00:15:53.670
As elegant as I'd expect from you...

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:57.060
is what I'd like to say, but I don't know.

00:15:59.660 --> 00:16:02.630
Isn't it because you fear my skill?

00:16:03.570 --> 00:16:08.500
A blade would cause my 
Spearing Eye to activate.

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:11.240
But a branch would cause no great damage.

00:16:12.960 --> 00:16:16.780
Don't overestimate your 
own techniques so much.

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:23.580
Joujin-sama's order not to 
slay you remains in effect.

00:16:24.010 --> 00:16:26.840
I won't use Ouka anymore.

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:31.050
I told you not to overestimate yourself.

00:16:31.350 --> 00:16:36.070
That incomplete technique 
you could not control...

00:16:36.070 --> 00:16:38.350
Perhaps Joujin-sama gave up on it.

00:16:38.630 --> 00:16:41.100
Then, why still come after us?

00:16:41.370 --> 00:16:42.900
I couldn't say...

00:16:42.900 --> 00:16:47.160
If you wish to know, 
ask Joujin-sama yourself.

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:50.270
I shall take you to him whenever you like.

00:16:56.340 --> 00:16:57.620
Hibiki!

00:16:58.680 --> 00:17:00.120
What's wrong, Hibiki—

00:17:22.960 --> 00:17:25.270
Now, think about it...

00:17:25.710 --> 00:17:31.530
Will your Spearing Eye work on 
my Reverse Halberd of Time?

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:34.290
I know your weakness.

00:17:34.970 --> 00:17:40.030
Once you've used the Reverse Halberd 
of Time, you can't use it again for a while.

00:17:40.360 --> 00:17:42.540
Why not try it?

00:17:42.860 --> 00:17:46.540
Let us see what happens when we use 
our techniques on one another.

00:18:14.600 --> 00:18:15.820
Why?

00:18:15.980 --> 00:18:19.330
You used your Spearing Eye, yes.

00:18:20.720 --> 00:18:23.450
But why did it not work?

00:18:25.030 --> 00:18:27.460
That is simple.

00:18:28.350 --> 00:18:30.830
It couldn't reach me.

00:18:32.640 --> 00:18:35.660
I see that what is emitted by your eyes

00:18:35.660 --> 00:18:38.720
cannot overcome the reverse flow of time.

00:18:39.420 --> 00:18:42.090
You seem unable to accept that...

00:18:42.950 --> 00:18:45.980
Want to try again?

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:47.230
What?

00:18:47.950 --> 00:18:51.740
If you're certain I cannot immediately use 
the Reverse Halberd of Time again,

00:18:51.740 --> 00:18:53.790
then no need to worry about a thing.

00:18:54.160 --> 00:18:58.740
If I only used it for a moment, a moment 
is all it takes to recover.

00:18:59.370 --> 00:19:02.830
This time, I will show no mercy.

00:19:05.010 --> 00:19:06.540
Utsutsu, what's wrong?!

00:19:06.940 --> 00:19:08.250
Hibiki...

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:11.030
Follow Hibiki...

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:12.570
Hurry!

00:19:26.840 --> 00:19:27.890
Hibiki...

00:19:34.390 --> 00:19:36.400
Hibiki! Hibiki, wait!

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:38.980
Hibiki, what happened?

00:19:39.410 --> 00:19:40.810
You, huh?

00:19:42.190 --> 00:19:43.560
Neirichiou?

00:19:43.920 --> 00:19:45.280
You...

00:19:53.090 --> 00:20:00.300
As I thought, this technique doesn't stop 
at stealing an enemy's will to fight.

00:20:00.620 --> 00:20:01.760
No...

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:05.960
When its limiters are removed, 
it can do harm, as well.

00:20:06.440 --> 00:20:09.060
Just as Joujin-sama said.

00:20:09.410 --> 00:20:12.530
Now come, Iga Hibiki...

00:20:13.180 --> 00:20:16.140
Joujin-sama is waiting.

00:21:05.840 --> 00:21:08.870
My... face!

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:26.960
<b><i>Preview</i></b>

00:23:25.990 --> 00:23:30.880
You wish to recover Iga Hibiki-dono, 
who's trapped within the Murakumo.

00:23:30.880 --> 00:23:33.730
I wish to recover Tadanaga-sama.

00:23:34.220 --> 00:23:35.820
If we want the same things,

00:23:34.220 --> 00:23:37.220
<b><i>The Massive Castle Rumbles</i></b>

00:23:35.820 --> 00:23:38.230
there is no reason for us 
not to work together.

00:23:38.430 --> 00:23:39.280
How about it?
